{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他发现对方没有因为自己的在意而退开，逐渐放松；自己也想靠近，却还是把冲动收住了。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、放松、克制、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"左手像心跳、身体被托住，右手旋律像肩膀相贴的具体画面，需要读小字才能理解。还有他为什么收住——怕太急破坏眼下的自在——因果细节不容易一眼抓全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"对方愿意继续亲近让他放松，他喜欢得几乎藏不住，却怕破坏现在的舒服状态而克制自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、安心、克制、微酸、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的‘几次柔软的落音像一根温柔的刺’以及‘眼前的好还在，心里却先有一点鼻酸’，虽然补充了重要感受，但字号较小，容易一眼漏掉。音乐画面与人物情绪的对应关系也需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为对方没有退开而慢慢放松，想进一步靠近却忍住了，同时已经开始害怕这段舒服的相处会过去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、放松、克制、鼻酸、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的‘歌声忽然往上涌了一次，接着轻轻呼出一口气，回到柔和’这一段音乐变化需要读小字才能理解；‘没有把心事彻底说死’也不容易在扫读中抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条大号文字本身有明确的叙事关系：对方没有退开，所以他放松；他想靠近，却怕破坏自在而收住；因为知道美好时刻会过去，所以提前舍不得。人物处境和感受总体是串起来的。主要问题是三条大号长句同时占据较强的视觉位置，每条又包含不止一层意思，第一眼容易抓到‘放松’‘喜欢得藏不住’‘收住了’‘舍不得’这些词，却不一定马上建立完整的因果关系。音乐画面与人物情绪的联系主要靠字号较小的补充文字建立。第三张又增加了一条醒目的红色说明，进一步增加了视觉竞争。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "79faea39-a42c-4a84-8ad3-9cde81981ab0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223654368272Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:38:43.445303+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "94cb471f527f16975eeb8a6ba1701b91ad2024b51dc8241aafb58a18e04a6660", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223654368272Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e82896f5fa41b58ff1a65e231aabc2394f1f3fcfe0945084dc9280397854769d"}}}
